OL,3,GNEWSAFlood defence scheme costing #42m
OL,4,Aopened
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn upgraded flood defence scheme,
OL,7,Fdesigned to reduce the risk to 1,870
OL,8,Fhomes and 575 businesses has been
OL,9,Fofficially opened by the Environment
OL,10,FAgency (EA).
OL,12,FThe scheme, between Tonbridge and
OL,13,FHildenborough, cost #42m and will also
OL,14,Fbenefit communities further downstream
OL,15,Fon the River Medway.
OL,17,FThe EA said it will help communities
OL,18,Frespond to the growing challenge posed
OL,19,Fby climate change, with increased
OL,20,Flikelihood of more frequent severe
OL,21,Fstorms and extremely wet winters.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
