OL,3,GNEWSAFlood defence scheme costing #42m
OL,4,Aopened
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added the capacity of the Leigh
OL,7,FFlood Storage Area has now been
OL,8,Fincreased by 23%, so it can now hold
OL,9,Fapproximately 7.4m cubic metres of
OL,10,Ffloodwater - equivalent to around 2,880
OL,11,FOlympic-sized swimming pools.
